      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "G2｜角色稳定\n\n状态：IN_PROGRESS\nQ-CHAR-001：R1 baseline CLEAR（79个基础头像）\nMAIN-03：R1–R3 DONE，协议已冻结\n当前：R2 ASSET_RESYNC PREFLIGHT RUNNING / WAIT_CODEX_RECEIPT\n案例：CH-004 青色路域勘察员",
      "x": 520,
