      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "G3｜场景稳定\n\n状态：IN_PROGRESS / BLOCKED_ON_APPROVED_BASE_ASSET\n已确认动画背景风格方向\n缺口：用户批准的唯一森林背景原件尚未绑定绝对路径 + SHA256",
      "x": 520,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "G4｜分镜 / 镜头稳定\n\nV10-B｜CHAR-STORYBOARD\n状态：BLOCKED_SOURCE_MISMATCH\n当前指定 thread 只支持纯色角色/小世界视觉发散\n缺真正 event → storyboard / shot decomposition / continuity 成功源",
