    },
    {
      "id": "qchar001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Q-CHAR-001｜头像稳定扩展到中全景\n\n状态：ACTIVE / R2 RUNNING\nR1：79头像 baseline CLEAR\nMAIN-03 R1–R3：DONE，MAIN03-AVATAR-TO-BODY-v1 已冻结\nCURRENT：HEAD-R2-ASSET-RESYNC-PREFLIGHT\nSTOP：WAIT_CODEX_RECEIPT\nCH-004：真实案例",
      "x": 980,
      "y": -570,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "case_ch004",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "黎黎隆项目/03_角色/角色库/角色卡/CH-004_青色路域勘察员.md",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -610,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "case_ch004_flow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## CASE｜头像扩展文字设定\n\nCH-004 青色路域勘察员\n\n单头像\n→ 文字身份 / 职业\n→ 青色世界位置（X并Z → 生Z / 路域）\n→ 冻结项 / 可发散项\n→ 四宫格中景 / 中全景\n→ 角色一致性验证\n\n当前：CHAR-4PANEL NEXT",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "sync_note",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GitHub 同步说明\n\n2026-10-04：因远端此前缺少 canonical Canvas 文件，本次按已冻结的 G0→G1…G9 架构建立 GitHub 同路径镜像，并登记 CH-004 案例。\n\n本文件不得被旧版 `黎黎隆_问题系统_Canvas_v1` 反向覆盖；后续本地 canonical 若包含更多 Q 节点，应做增量合并。",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": -570,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "v10a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## V10-A｜TOPVIEW-WORLD｜体量10\n\n状态：BLOCKED_CODEX_CLI_ENVIRONMENT\n\n已就绪：\n- TOPVIEW_WORLD_REPRO_PACK_v1.md\n- 3张恢复参考图 SHA 已核\n\n最新真实执行：\nCODEX-RUN-20261004-19-W1\ncodex --version / codex exec --help 均 CommandNotFound\nchild_process_started=false\n\nNEXT：\n修复/提供本地 Codex CLI 绝对入口 → 新 dispatch 明确重授权 → fresh clean-room child",
      "x": 980,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "v10b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## V10-B｜CHAR-STORYBOARD｜体量10\n\n状态：BLOCKED_SOURCE_MISMATCH\n\n指定 source thread 已核：\n01a0cebf-913c-7631-98d0-ee2f8b7a6398\n\n证据只支持：\n纯色角色 / 小世界视觉发散\n\n缺：\nevent → storyboard\nshot decomposition\ncontinuity 成功链\n\nNEXT：重新定位真正的已有角色分镜化成功源",
      "x": 980,
      "y": -70,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hourly_status_sync",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HOURLY STATUS SYNC｜2026-10-04\n\n这是状态同步，不另开研究树。\n\n已同步：\n- V10-A：BLOCKED_CODEX_CLI_ENVIRONMENT\n- V10-B：BLOCKED_SOURCE_MISMATCH\n- Q-CHAR-001：R2 RUNNING / WAIT_CODEX_RECEIPT\n- G3：BLOCKED_ON_APPROVED_BASE_ASSET\n\n纪律：\n每小时收束结果都必须回到唯一正本；\nDONE/BLOCKED/RUNNING 只以真实 receipt / artifact 为准。",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1_l4_compiler",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# L1–L4｜问题上下文编译层\n\n状态：M-END = CLOSED（逻辑+本地实现已验收）\n\nL1 信息提取：事实 / 来源 / 冲突 / 不确定项\nL2 专业分类：角色 / 风格 / 世界观 / 流程 / 资产等路由\nL3 Problem Agent：建立/合并正式 Problem Node，拦截重复/伪问题/假设\nL4 Problem State：形成当前唯一有效状态包，交给 L5/L6\n\n固定链：\n散乱来源 → L1 → L2 → L3 → L4 → Q-ID/问题树 → L5/L6 → 证据回写原Q\n\n规则：L1–L4 不另建第二套 Canvas；问题深度用 D1/D2/D3，避免与 Agent L1–L10 混淆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "problem_state_v1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Problem State v1｜已冻结\n\n核心字段：\nq_id / parent_goal / problem_statement / problem_depth(D1-D3) / domain / status\nknown / unknown / tried / rejected / current_hypotheses / evidence / source_refs\ncurrent_version / next_decision / done_condition / required_agent\n\nM3：3/3 真实样本完成\n- 头像/角色视觉：Q-CHAR-001.1\n- 流程/资产：Q-ASSET-001\n- 世界观/十元：Q-WORLD-001\n\nM4：3/3 L5/L6 消费测试 PASS\nM5：本地真实落地验收 PASS\nlocal commit: 51825b3b4bea924d956d69dd3b968956e74f861d"
    },
    {
      "id": "l1_l4_sync_debt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## GitHub 同步状态｜L1–L4\n\n总 Canvas 导航：已同步\n\n仍未同步到 GitHub main 的本地实现文件：\n- 黎黎隆问题总纲.md（L1–L4/Problem State 落地版）\n- 问题卡模板.md\n- Q-CHAR-001.1\n- Q-ASSET-001\n- Q-WORLD-001\n\n这些文件在本地 M5 commit 已验收，但 GitHub 搜索仍缺失。\n\nNEXT：Recover local canonical → 对比 remote → 增量上传，禁止凭聊天重建第二份。"
    }
